  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. Crumb the British cheese into a bowl.",
    "3. Tear the knotted bread into small pieces and add to the bowl.",
    "4. Mix in the cottage cheese, egg, salt, and black pepper.",
    "5. Grease a baking dish with butter.",
    "6. Add the bread mixture to the baking dish.",
    "7. Top with additional British cheese if desired.",
